00:06:08,512 --> 00:06:13,284
At what point do we start losing maintainers because of these concerns like burnout?

54
00:06:13,518 --> 00:06:29,712
While project leaders generally agree that AI effectively lowers the barrier to contribution, this accessibility comes at the cost of decreased community trust, higher mentorship demands for new contributors, and a highly fragmented landscape for AI contribution policies and verification methods.

