57
00:06:49,422 --> 00:06:58,832
Contributors and maintainers report that these tools reduce the time required for OSS development with an average time savings ranging from 19 to 52% depending on the task.

58
00:06:59,054 --> 00:07:07,312
Maintainers specifically benefit from highly efficient technical discussions and proposal reviews, saving between 25 to 40% of their time.

59
00:07:07,552 --> 00:07:12,752
Gains that 66% of respondents reinvest directly into addressing technical debt.

60
00:07:12,912 --> 00:07:18,884
