61% of contributors conduct detailed line-by-line reviews and full functional testing of AI-generated code before submission, and 80% emphasize the importance of understanding the underlying source model and training data lineage.

63
00:07:36,672 --> 00:07:46,672
To resolve the core tensions surrounding the use of Gen AI in OSS development, projects must move from reactive management to intentional contribution policy and workflow design.

64
00:07:46,926 --> 00:07:56,260
Successful communities are establishing clear, transparent guidelines that, instead of forbidding Gen AI or naively accepting all Gen AI results, pass.

